setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 301
text I feel something.
text I can feel something like ripples spreading across the room.
text And they resonate with each other like a beautiful piece of music.
text Like a small wish we had together when we were children.
text Like the clear sky we've long since forgotten.
text Something we cannot see. Something we cannot touch.
text Something the world lost a long time ago...
text But it exists right here.
text It's gently watching over the girl hugging her stuffed animal.
sound EGA.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy... Daddy...
text Kotomi speaks to it.
sound EGB.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I was waiting for you all this time.
sound EGC.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I was waiting at home all by myself.
sound EGD.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text It felt so lonely that I cried all the time.
sound EGE.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I hated what had happened, so I cried all the time, all alone.
sound EGF.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text And then...
sound EGG.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun came for me.
sound EGH.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text He told me that the outside world isn't scary.
sound EGI.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text He told me to go outside with him.
sound EGJ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text He told me that he will always be with me.
sound EGK.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text That's why I went outside.
sound EGL.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text The outside world isn't scary at all.
sound EGM.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text When I said the sky is pretty, Tomoya-kun smiled for me.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKT09B"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s8
fi
goto 9
label s8
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 9
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound EGN.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I really, really like Tomoya-kun...
sound EGO.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text And I made lots of friends.
sound EGP.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text We're all really close, and they're all so kind to me.
sound EGQ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text We talk together and we go outside to play together.
sound EGR.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Just being with everyone is so much fun.
sound EGS.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text There are times when things get sad and difficult, but I'm fine as long as I'm with everyone.
sound EGT.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text And I started playing the violin again.
sound EGU.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Everyone said they'll give me one as a present.
sound EGV.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text It's a very wonderful violin.
sound EGW.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text That's why... that's why...
sound EGX.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Right now, I'm very happy.
sound EGY.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'm very, very happy. I'm so happy that I... that I...
sound EGZ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text So...
sound EH0.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy... Daddy...
